    "idea": "The first-run experience the audit found nobody owned: the ordered sequence of screens from install to first score, the full demographic field-set, the question-side cold-start (minimal bootstrap set → progressive profiling), and where consent & device-pairing sit. It hands off to the question bank (Appendix E), persona determination (Appendix I), goals (Appendix J) and the Onboarding sub-machine on the patient state machine.",
    "links": ["Doc 01", "Doc 11", "Doc 14", "Doc 15", "Doc 18", "Appendix E", "Appendix I", "Appendix J", "states.html"]
